## Configure 

Below we load the packages for app design (`bslib`, `bsicons`), the making the API request (`httr2`), and monitoring and logging (`logger` and `jsonlite`):





::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code  code-fold="false"}
library(shiny)
library(bslib)
library(bsicons)
library(httr2)
library(logger)
library(jsonlite)

# configure logging 
logger::log_threshold(level = "DEBUG")
logger::log_appender(appender = appender_tee(file = "shiny_app.log"))
logger::log_formatter(logger::formatter_glue_or_sprintf)
```
:::





